Hello everyone,

A friendly reminder that the third quarter ends today.

If you have any open expenses from July, August or September, please submit them this week. Expenses must be submitted within 30 days, with a photo or scan of every receipt. Claims without receipts will be sent back to you.

Finance closes the quarter on Wednesday 7 October. Claims that arrive after that date will still be paid, but they will move to the next month's payment.

If you are not sure whether something can be claimed, please check the expenses policy on the intranet or ask your manager before you spend the money.

Thank you for helping us close the quarter on time.

Kind regards,
